# ── machina / solana-crypto-trader — project .gitignore ──────────────────────
# Secret-safe by construction. The hard rule: no private keys, seed phrases,
# wallet files, RPC credentials, or generated data ever enter version control.
# Only *.example.toml config TEMPLATES are tracked; real config is ignored.

# ── Secrets, keys, wallets (NEVER commit) ────────────────────────────────────
*.key
*.keypair
*keypair*.json
*-keypair.json
id.json
*.pem
*.seed
*.mnemonic
*.wallet
wallet*.json
# …but the wallet-snapshot JSON Schema is a tracked research CONTRACT (schemas-as-contracts,
# D-0001), not a wallet file — without this negation it was silently untracked and a clean
# checkout failed crates/results/tests/schema_validation.rs (found 2026-07-07).
!schemas/wallet-snapshot.schema.json
secrets/
.secrets/
*.secret
*.secret.toml
*.secret.json

# ── Environment files ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env

# ── Real config (only *.example.toml templates are tracked) ──────────────────
config/**/*.toml
!config/**/*.example.toml
# M5-C3 exception: the frozen research policy is a checked-in artifact (no secrets; Q5 ratchet).
!config/strategies/m5-frozen.toml

# ── Rust build artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/target
**/target
# Cargo.lock IS tracked (committed) for reproducible CI — do not ignore it.

# ── Generated data, normalized series, and exported results ──────────────────
/data/raw/
/data/normalized/
/data/**/*.parquet
/data/**/*.csv
/data/**/*.db
/data/**/*.sqlite
/results/**/*.json
/results/**/*.csv
/results/**/*.ndjson
# keep directory placeholders + checked-in example artifacts
!**/.gitkeep
!**/*.example.json
!**/*.example.csv

# ── Crate fixtures stay tracked (tiny, checked-in test inputs) ────────────────
!crates/**/fixtures/**

# ── OS / editor cruft ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# ── Local agent tooling (cadence engine, machine-local settings) ─────────────
.claude/settings.local.json

# ── Personal playbook (portable, not a project artifact) ─────────────────────
/FOREMAN.md
plans/reports/agent-drift-audit-2026-07-17.md
